      "message": "If you follow it through, you will see that all it does is set a new state rather than NotRunning. The only consequence of which is that we get a different log message if this path has been followed and we hit the \"Rust call failed\" assert. So, unless I\u0027m missing something, I believe this to be no functional change. Have I missed something?",
