        "id": 2038727
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-19T02:29:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`Start` cannot be called twice without an intervening `Stop` so the state will never be `Running` here. Would it help if we only change to this new state if the current state is `NotRunning` (which should always be the case anyway, but I can make that change if it makes you feel more comfortable)?",
      "parentUuid": "ab31e19f_c20b41d2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 63,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 63,
