      "writtenOn": "2025-02-19T02:39:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I understand that your use, but I don\u0027t like adding an unsafe function like this.\nLet me propose a different change: introduce a initial state instead, which we never transition back to:\n\n- Init (default) -start()-\u003e Running\n- NotRunning -start()-\u003e Running\n- Running -stop()-\u003e NotRunning\n\nWould that still help for your debugging ?",
      "parentUuid": "1275f01c_39b2335c",
      "range": {
